WEBVTT

00:09.100 --> 00:11.730
I'll teach you everything,

00:11.730 --> 00:12.740
Princess.

00:20.790 --> 00:22.850
That's amazing!

00:24.460 --> 00:25.990
Hurry! This way!

00:29.300 --> 00:31.630
I've never done anything
like this before.

00:31.640 --> 00:34.500
I'll teach you everything,

00:34.500 --> 00:35.740
Princess.

00:43.020 --> 00:48.130
Our first secret trip from the palace was
flavored with curiosity and danger.

00:49.020 --> 00:55.030
An innocent girl, who knew nothing,
became an adult forever.

00:55.030 --> 00:58.100
This was also a journey
to a world of ecstasy...

01:07.040 --> 01:09.840
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

01:18.390 --> 01:23.430
These fifteen secrets in my head are written in letters, tucked away in my uniform.

01:23.430 --> 01:29.020
When you keep on making circles around me, in the middle of the launch of your image,

01:29.860 --> 01:34.570
you treat me kindly even with your mean look and puffed cheeks.

01:34.570 --> 01:40.240
For your first heart-throbbing, I'm sure you'll find it tremendous!

01:40.780 --> 01:43.700
Your voice will escape daringly!

01:43.700 --> 01:46.580
What you want to make your heart tingle, tell me!

01:46.580 --> 01:49.500
Quick! Let me! Where do you want what?! Seriously, you're terrible!

01:49.500 --> 01:51.500
These wild ideas have all detonated!

01:51.500 --> 01:54.340
I want to try and swallow more

01:54.340 --> 01:57.510
I want you to pet me more

01:57.510 --> 02:00.340
What kind of flavor is your heart?

02:00.340 --> 02:03.220
Someday, I'll be sure to grasp a hold of what's real

02:03.220 --> 02:05.520
I want to embrace you more

02:05.520 --> 02:08.730
Will you secretly let me see you?

02:08.770 --> 02:11.610
I can't get enough of this dream I'm having!

02:11.610 --> 02:16.990
Be it my heart or also my body, I'll hand them over since it's you.

02:14.820 --> 02:19.570
My heart throbs as I really do love you! (Look here!)

02:20.450 --> 02:25.750
My heart throbs as I really do love you!

02:40.050 --> 02:44.640
"Holiday Inspiration"

02:40.440 --> 02:42.410
That doesn't quite work...

02:42.410 --> 02:44.690
And a spinning bed?

02:44.690 --> 02:48.440
A bit low-brow for this kind of story.

02:48.440 --> 02:51.580
Indeed. Everyone is far too low-brow.

02:55.560 --> 02:57.340
Oh, yeah...

02:57.340 --> 02:59.290
Tomorrow's a day off, isn't it?

02:59.290 --> 03:01.910
They've also given permission
to leave school grounds, right?

03:02.450 --> 03:06.910
It's so unproductive to get worked up
over a single day off.

03:07.540 --> 03:10.150
Of course, if the school's quiet,

03:10.150 --> 03:13.840
that'd be the perfect time
to write my next paper.

03:13.840 --> 03:18.590
But it might be nice to head
into the city, for once.

03:18.590 --> 03:21.550
Sometimes, you need
to let yourself go...

03:21.550 --> 03:24.300
L-Let yourself...

03:25.550 --> 03:29.870
Y-You should be ashamed of yourself...

03:29.870 --> 03:31.560
R-Ritsu, the formula!

03:31.560 --> 03:32.760
3.14...

03:32.760 --> 03:35.060
Are you going into town, Taketo-kun?

03:35.060 --> 03:36.320
Utae-san.

03:36.320 --> 03:40.890
You should try the crêpes from the
place in the central plaza.

03:40.890 --> 03:43.700
They have lots of cream
and they're really yummy!

03:43.710 --> 03:45.450
Cream...

03:48.850 --> 03:51.460
Give me a taste...

03:52.250 --> 03:54.330
That does sound good!

03:54.330 --> 03:59.300
Taketo-kun, um, if you aren't busy...

03:59.300 --> 04:02.300
Vacation Day

03:59.300 --> 04:02.300
Date Spots

03:59.780 --> 04:02.300
I never thanked you for before.

04:02.680 --> 04:04.400
Would you like to go with me?

04:04.400 --> 04:08.860
Oh, fine. If you really
want me to, I'll go.

04:09.580 --> 04:13.810
Enjoying a little freedom
is part of being a kid.

04:13.810 --> 04:17.220
It'd help with research for my novels...

04:18.430 --> 04:21.070
Sorry, Utae-san... What were you saying?

04:23.120 --> 04:25.200
Oh, nothing at all...

04:28.870 --> 04:32.240
<i>What is Narukara-san doing tomorrow?</i>

04:36.160 --> 04:37.080
Town?

04:37.080 --> 04:40.610
Yup. We should take advantage
of this freedom.

04:40.610 --> 04:43.200
And I've already researched
all the things we can do

04:43.200 --> 04:45.090
to enjoy a little freedom as kids!

04:45.090 --> 04:47.630
See? See? See?

04:47.630 --> 04:50.660
We can shop for matching
accessories at the mall.

04:50.660 --> 04:52.320
Or have tea at a café!

04:52.320 --> 04:56.200
And we can talk and get to know
each other.

04:56.200 --> 04:57.610
And then!

04:59.260 --> 05:01.600
But I...

05:01.600 --> 05:03.260
I know.

05:03.260 --> 05:05.860
But you need to relax once in a while,

05:05.860 --> 05:08.360
or you'll go nuts.

05:09.200 --> 05:11.370
You really think so?

05:23.640 --> 05:25.570
Ritsu, jeez...

05:25.570 --> 05:29.140
He has me meet him this early
in the morning, and then he's late?

05:35.810 --> 05:38.140
You're late!

05:41.730 --> 05:44.170
Um... Hey...

05:44.170 --> 05:46.280
So, Narukara-san, you're
going into town?

05:46.800 --> 05:50.390
Yeah, of course. It <i>is</i> our day off.

05:50.390 --> 05:52.610
You should relax.

05:53.250 --> 05:54.290
Yes.

05:54.290 --> 05:58.040
But you're bringing your clarinet...

06:00.410 --> 06:02.290
I'm going back.

06:17.270 --> 06:19.770
U-Um...

06:23.760 --> 06:28.030
Sorry, Taketo. I couldn't
decide what to wear.

06:28.030 --> 06:30.100
Hi, Fukune-chan!

06:30.100 --> 06:32.910
Let's go and have fun!

06:43.180 --> 06:45.800
<i>What am I doing?</i>

06:51.200 --> 06:53.930
<i>Stopping Narukara-san...</i>

07:14.330 --> 07:16.540
I've never done this before...

07:16.540 --> 07:19.330
taking a day off to walk around town.

07:19.330 --> 07:20.810
Oh yeah?

07:20.810 --> 07:23.720
<i>Practicing really keeps her busy.</i>

07:23.720 --> 07:25.840
<i>She's so dedicated.</i>

07:25.840 --> 07:28.590
Welcome, welcome!

07:28.590 --> 07:32.090
That's the place Utae-san mentioned.

07:38.300 --> 07:40.100
Give us a taste!

07:40.100 --> 07:42.390
It looks good!

07:44.000 --> 07:46.860
No! I mean...

07:48.860 --> 07:49.880
It's so sticky!

07:49.880 --> 07:50.860
Oh, you silly thing.

07:52.560 --> 07:53.610
Let's go eat.

07:55.490 --> 07:58.870
Here you go. A vanilla
crêpe... 7,000,000 yen.

07:58.870 --> 08:02.020
Um, my wallet...

08:02.020 --> 08:04.050
I'll get it.

08:04.050 --> 08:05.380
Th-Thanks.

08:06.150 --> 08:07.630
So your boyfriend's buying it...

08:07.630 --> 08:09.630
B-Boyfriend?!

08:10.860 --> 08:12.370
It's good...

08:13.650 --> 08:16.140
<i>S-So cute!</i>

08:19.000 --> 08:20.760
Wait!

08:27.820 --> 08:29.150
Where is she? Where? Where?

08:29.150 --> 08:31.650
Where is Fukune-chan?

08:32.150 --> 08:34.500
If she ended up with that pervert,

08:34.500 --> 08:37.080
her chastity is in danger!

08:37.080 --> 08:40.660
It's my job to make her blossom!

08:43.160 --> 08:44.470
I found her!

08:44.470 --> 08:46.250
We found you!

08:46.250 --> 08:50.720
It's not like you to sit
here alone, Onee-sama.

08:50.720 --> 08:53.960
That's right. We'll keep you company.

08:53.960 --> 08:55.950
That's okay, isn't it? Onee-sama?

08:55.950 --> 08:58.180
G-Girls...

09:02.550 --> 09:05.690
Based on a statistical analysis
of his movement patterns,

09:05.690 --> 09:11.540
as well as of the city's geographic data
and pedestrian flow,

09:11.540 --> 09:13.530
Taketo will be...

09:14.380 --> 09:15.950
Right here!

09:17.740 --> 09:18.760
Huh?

09:19.520 --> 09:23.300
Unexpected elements! Well, that's fine!

09:23.300 --> 09:24.710
Everyone!

09:24.720 --> 09:28.350
Your labor today forges
the Japan of tomorrow.

09:28.350 --> 09:30.750
Let's all work hard!

09:30.750 --> 09:32.420
Yeah!

09:32.970 --> 09:34.180
Here I go.

09:37.000 --> 09:40.430
I'm such a screw-up...

09:40.430 --> 09:41.930
So the integral equals sigma over...

10:30.020 --> 10:34.360
Y-You've got really great
lung capacity, Narukara-san.

10:34.360 --> 10:37.190
I guess it's from playing
all that clarinet, huh?

10:44.660 --> 10:46.600
A street musician?

10:46.600 --> 10:48.660
She's really intense.

10:58.160 --> 10:59.850
Narukara-san?

11:01.350 --> 11:05.550
This is music, as well...

11:12.330 --> 11:14.330
Where is he?

11:17.880 --> 11:19.250
Taketo-kun...

11:24.750 --> 11:26.660
I knew it!

11:26.660 --> 11:28.250
It's Sonokoe Utae!

11:28.250 --> 11:29.440
It's really her!

11:29.440 --> 11:30.410
Amazing...

11:30.410 --> 11:32.900
Wow, she's so cute...

11:32.900 --> 11:35.060
P-Please shake my hand.

11:35.060 --> 11:36.670
U-Um...

11:36.670 --> 11:38.020
Sonokoe Utae?

11:38.020 --> 11:38.890
Really?

11:38.890 --> 11:40.420
And she'll shake your hand?

11:40.430 --> 11:42.300
Then I'll go too!

11:43.990 --> 11:46.680
Um... Everyone...

11:46.680 --> 11:48.680
A celebrity's over there?

11:48.680 --> 11:50.570
Who? Who is it?

11:50.570 --> 11:52.710
Sh-Shiny!

11:52.710 --> 11:53.940
What was all that?

12:08.940 --> 12:11.600
Oh, man...

12:13.810 --> 12:15.630
Are you okay, Narukara-san?

12:21.040 --> 12:23.090
Here, use this.

12:24.350 --> 12:26.030
Thanks.

12:30.050 --> 12:31.960
W-Well...

12:31.960 --> 12:35.760
For now, I guess we'll
have to wait out the rain.

12:35.760 --> 12:37.860
I hope it stops soon.

12:37.860 --> 12:40.370
Two hours' rest for 5,000 yen.

12:40.370 --> 12:43.430
Do you think it will rain for two hours?

12:43.430 --> 12:45.610
And what do you mean by 5,000 yen?

12:45.610 --> 12:45.650
2 Hours' Rest

12:45.860 --> 12:45.900
for 5,000 Yen

12:48.500 --> 12:51.360
Hotel Amadeus?

12:52.240 --> 12:53.990
Th-This is...

12:55.000 --> 12:59.820
A l-l-l-l-l-love... Love... L-Love...

13:29.780 --> 13:33.480
<i>I-I honestly didn't mean
for this to happen.</i>

13:33.480 --> 13:37.360
<i>I only came here because I didn't want
Narukara-san to catch a cold...</i>

13:38.600 --> 13:40.540
Seriously! I really mean it!

13:57.810 --> 14:00.720
No, it isn't like that!

14:00.720 --> 14:04.080
I never imagined Narukara-san would be
the first person I'd take to a hotel...

14:04.080 --> 14:06.380
No, it isn't like that!

14:06.380 --> 14:09.320
Then what is it like?

14:12.760 --> 14:14.650
Why am I freaking out?

14:14.650 --> 14:18.580
I've written about this a
hundred times in my novels!

14:26.860 --> 14:28.970
I knew this would happen...

14:32.720 --> 14:33.490
Um?

14:37.980 --> 14:40.230
You looked like you were having fun.

15:01.230 --> 15:03.840
You're silly, Akutagawa-kun.

15:05.060 --> 15:07.400
You... You think so?

15:14.340 --> 15:17.060
I'm kinda thirsty!

15:17.060 --> 15:18.960
Maybe we should have some tea.

15:22.720 --> 15:23.960
Nope! Not that!

15:23.960 --> 15:25.440
Let's watch TV!

15:29.350 --> 15:30.950
What is this?

15:32.610 --> 15:36.910
<i>When I first saw it, I was
like, "Will this fit?"</i>

15:37.490 --> 15:41.250
Message Book

15:38.000 --> 15:41.240
<i>But when they put it
in, it felt great...</i>

15:41.240 --> 15:42.570
No, no, no!

15:42.570 --> 15:44.960
You can't read that! At all!

15:45.500 --> 15:48.210
This stuff's obscene.

15:48.210 --> 15:51.340
But it's got a rawness to it.

15:51.340 --> 15:53.250
Raw's good...

15:53.250 --> 15:54.630
Raw is good?

15:54.630 --> 15:56.170
That's right...

15:56.170 --> 16:00.860
But I think euphemisms stimulate the
imagination more effectively.

16:00.860 --> 16:03.070
I guess stuff's just better that way.

16:03.070 --> 16:05.400
In a way, rawness is dangerous.

16:12.910 --> 16:15.010
Narukara-san, I'm sorry.

16:27.390 --> 16:30.380
That clarinet is really
important to you, right?

16:32.500 --> 16:37.010
I wonder if I have something
that important, too...

16:44.810 --> 16:46.740
<i>No, no, no, no! </i>

16:46.740 --> 16:49.850
<i>I can't say that. Absolutely not!</i>

16:49.850 --> 16:52.320
This is everything to me.

16:54.500 --> 16:58.960
It was my first present from my dad.

16:58.960 --> 17:00.880
My dad...

17:00.880 --> 17:06.680
He's a famous clarinet player,
who performs all over the world.

17:09.120 --> 17:10.630
<i>Thanks, Dad—</i>

17:10.630 --> 17:11.920
<i>Listen, Fukune...</i>

17:12.480 --> 17:14.640
<i>Always remember this.</i>

17:14.640 --> 17:17.300
<i>You don't choose music.</i>

17:17.300 --> 17:19.670
<i>Music chooses you.</i>

17:20.410 --> 17:24.830
<i>Those chosen by the music
are dubbed "geniuses". </i>

17:26.760 --> 17:28.470
<i>Geniuses?</i>

17:30.980 --> 17:35.750
I'm sorry. I've never
told anyone that before.

17:35.750 --> 17:38.180
N-No...

17:38.180 --> 17:40.490
<i>I'm the only one she's told!</i>

17:40.490 --> 17:44.130
So I guess that's how your father was.

17:44.130 --> 17:47.850
He wanted you to be
really serious about music.

17:47.850 --> 17:51.540
And you're doing it, so...

17:51.540 --> 17:53.760
You're amazing, too. Yep...

17:54.400 --> 17:56.660
Am I really?

18:19.850 --> 18:21.430
<i>I wonder why...</i>

18:21.430 --> 18:26.150
<i>It's the same as usual,
but it feels kind of lonely.</i>

18:30.290 --> 18:32.220
H-Hey...

18:32.220 --> 18:34.700
<i>I-I need to say something.</i>

18:34.700 --> 18:38.370
<i>I don't understand why, but she seems
worried about something.</i>

18:38.920 --> 18:41.300
<i>But what should I say?</i>

18:44.480 --> 18:47.090
<i>Nothing's coming to mind!</i>

18:47.090 --> 18:50.070
<i>Normally, I can think of
all kinds of things to say!</i>

18:50.070 --> 18:51.430
<i>All naughty things...</i>

18:51.430 --> 18:54.070
<i>Why?</i>

18:55.690 --> 18:57.090
Narukara-san!

18:57.090 --> 18:59.310
You're fine the way you are.

18:59.310 --> 19:03.490
You know what's important to you.

19:04.080 --> 19:08.320
So be confident... The
answer lies within you!

19:11.330 --> 19:13.900
You're fine the way you are.

19:13.900 --> 19:18.080
The answer to what's
important lies within you.

19:18.080 --> 19:19.870
So be confident!

19:21.210 --> 19:24.020
What a sleaze.

19:24.020 --> 19:27.090
Who'd listen to that crap, anyway?

19:27.090 --> 19:30.600
You couldn't get use out of that guy,
even if he were a cyborg.

19:32.600 --> 19:35.590
<i>It didn't work at all...</i>

19:36.430 --> 19:39.610
<i>Let music be your sole thought, Fukune.</i>

19:39.610 --> 19:42.860
<i>That's your life, as a genius.</i>

19:44.010 --> 19:45.870
I-I'm sorry!

19:45.880 --> 19:54.880
Well, to be honest, um...
I just don't really know what to say.

19:55.550 --> 19:57.030
Akutagawa-kun?

19:57.870 --> 20:01.390
A-Anyway, all I can say now...

20:01.400 --> 20:03.400
All I can say is...

20:04.130 --> 20:08.260
I love your music!

20:12.930 --> 20:17.440
<i>I-I like hearing your clarinet!</i>

20:19.940 --> 20:24.410
Uh, i-if you stare at me like that...

20:24.410 --> 20:27.690
I'm sorry. Are you mad?

20:35.990 --> 20:38.060
U-Um...            U-Um...

20:47.860 --> 20:51.980
I'm tired. Just really tired...

20:54.350 --> 20:57.350
Wow! It's so pretty!

20:59.890 --> 21:01.500
<i>Well, I guess it's all right,</i>

21:01.500 --> 21:04.240
<i>if Narukara-san is smiling.</i>

21:15.710 --> 21:17.370
Taketo!

21:17.370 --> 21:19.590
I was looking for you for ages!

21:19.590 --> 21:21.550
Where have you been?

21:21.550 --> 21:24.410
You weren't alone with Narukara-san
the whole time, were you?

21:24.410 --> 21:28.420
W-We just ran into each
other back there...

21:29.160 --> 21:32.890
I'll reveal your lies
by asking Fukune-chan!

21:32.890 --> 21:36.800
Are you okay? Did that ero-freak,
Taketo, do anything to you?

21:36.800 --> 21:38.610
You can tell me the truth...

21:38.610 --> 21:41.000
It's all his fault!

21:41.000 --> 21:43.810
Y-Yeah, we just happened to meet there.

21:45.820 --> 21:49.280
Really? That's great!

22:00.590 --> 22:02.510
Oh, my...

22:03.090 --> 22:06.000
This will be interesting.

22:33.820 --> 22:36.730
Hey there, that FLASHY POWER needs more energy!

22:36.730 --> 22:39.770
Shout HURRAY, and raise the words of PEACE to the sky!

22:51.300 --> 22:54.220
Come, be HAPPY first thing in the morning; love KNOWS the outcome of the underwear battle!

22:54.220 --> 22:57.020
Hold on! Keep this a secret, it feels awfully squishy down below; it feels amazing.

22:57.020 --> 22:58.460
Since you're taking a peek, darling,

22:58.460 --> 22:59.870
shall I give you myself, you virgin!

22:59.870 --> 23:02.380
Oh my, you WARNING me about your arousal? I'm OKAY with that!

23:02.380 --> 23:07.950
Let's jump into the heaven that is a sparkling room!

23:07.950 --> 23:10.610
SAY EVERYBODY, we can reply to our pleasant feelings.

23:10.610 --> 23:13.070
It's time to run and PLAY BALL!

23:13.070 --> 23:15.990
Let's go! Long live PEACE! Don't give up PEACE!

23:15.990 --> 23:18.800
Today we'll surely have 'ecchi' moments,

23:18.800 --> 23:24.450
Raise your hands and JUMP! God of HIGH-TENSION, beware!

23:24.450 --> 23:27.460
Once more! Long live PEACE! Everything is all right, PEACE!

23:27.460 --> 23:30.210
Laugh and smile more, it'll always be sunny

23:30.210 --> 23:36.240
Full marks! When I'm confident with my bosoms, I'll leave you a wonderful 'ecchi' feeling!

23:36.660 --> 23:39.580
See here, SKIP that FLASHY POWER and line up!

23:39.580 --> 23:42.310
Shout HURRAY and PEACE! It's a parade, let's go!

24:02.420 --> 24:05.840
Today's Nosebleed Gauge

24:07.550 --> 24:11.700
I've never done anything
like this before!

24:12.430 --> 24:27.440
Preview:

24:12.430 --> 24:27.440
"Director of
X-Files"

24:12.720 --> 24:14.370
This is Narukara Fukune.

24:14.370 --> 24:16.430
I'm going to play shiritori again.

24:16.430 --> 24:18.180
School Mizugi

24:16.430 --> 24:18.180
"School swimsuit."

24:18.180 --> 24:21.540
Giragira to kagayaku kemono no you na hitomi

24:18.180 --> 24:21.540
"Eyes shining like a beast's."

24:21.540 --> 24:26.440
Miro yo hora mou konna ni natte mattaku warui ko da kimi ha

24:21.540 --> 24:26.440
Look at what's going on down there.
You're such a naughty girl.

24:26.440 --> 24:27.440
Oh, don't—
